        "created_at": "2014-01-08T21:59:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>King of Toyko Promo plus 8 Promo cards for my favorite game in the world?&nbsp; Plus I get to support the Dice Tower?&nbsp; That's worth it to me.</p><p>Question to anyone who's used Kickstarter before (this is my first time; I got into Sentinels after the Vengeance kickstarter had ended).&nbsp; I used my Amazon account to pay for it; it never asked for a shipping address.</p><p>Am I safe to assume it's going to use my shipping address stored to my Amazon account?</p>",
